      "body": "Quick Answer\n\nThe Oil Tycoon release date is 2026-07-08, the day the jitmoney inc universe went live on Roblox. The official game page shows a last-updated date of 2026-09-20, which is the most recent signal that the launch window is still active as of research date 2026-09-29. Future roadmap content beyond that last-updated date is unconfirmed and is not officially announced by jitmoney inc on the store page.\n\nOil Tycoon Release Date and Launch Window\n\nThe Oil Tycoon release date is 2026-07-08, taken from the universe creation date on the official Roblox store page at https://www.roblox.com/games/105072660911040/Oil-Tycoon. The store page also lists the developer as jitmoney inc, with Universe 10466601694 and Place 105072660911040 as the canonical identifiers. Treat 2026-07-08 as the public launch date for Oil Tycoon on the platform.\n\nThere is no separate soft-launch or beta phase documented on the official game page; the universe creation date is the earliest publicly visible signal that the game became joinable on Roblox. Because Oil Tycoon is a 2026 release with no original-game or legacy counterpart, there is no earlier title whose launch date needs to be reconciled with this one. The launch window is the period from 2026-07-08 onward, and it is the only launch window this page covers.\n\nLast Updated Signal and Update Log\n\nThe official Oil Tycoon store page shows a last-updated date of 2026-09-20. That signal is what tells readers, as of research date 2026-09-29, that the launch window is still active rather than closed. A last-updated date inside the active launch window means the developer is still publishing changes, but it does not enumerate what those changes are.\n\nThe store page itself does not expose a structured in-game update log as of research date 2026-09-29. Players who want a per-patch breakdown can join the jitmoney inc community channels (see the Discord companion page for community entry points) and look at the pinned patch notes there. Any patch-note quote used by this site must carry a research-date stamp and attribution rather than being repeated as if it were an official in-page statement.\n\nFuture Roadmap: Unconfirmed as of 2026-09-29\n\nFuture roadmap content for Oil Tycoon, including new worlds, new NPCs beyond shopkeep Miguel, new secret areas, new badges, new codes, or any change to the harvest-upgrade-sell loop, is not officially announced as of research date 2026-09-29. The store page does not list a roadmap section, and jitmoney inc has not published a roadmap on a platform that this site can cite as official. Treat every \"what comes next\" claim you see elsewhere as unconfirmed until the official page changes.\n\nThe right way to read this section is as a guard against acting on rumors. If you see a third-party post claiming that a new area, new secret ending, new badge or new code is \"coming soon,\" the only signal that should update your plan is a change to the official Oil Tycoon Roblox page itself or to an announcement on the jitmoney inc channels. Until that change happens, the dated position as of 2026-09-29 is that no future roadmap content is officially confirmed.\n\nWhat the Research Date on This Page Means\n\nEvery fact on this page is anchored to research date 2026-09-29. The Oil Tycoon release date, the last-updated date and the launch-window status are all snapshot values taken from the store page on that day. When the store page changes, the values on this page will need to be refreshed on the next content pass.\n\nIf you are reading this page after the research date stamped at the bottom, treat the launch-window and last-updated statements as the historical record of what was true on 2026-09-29 rather than as a live status. For a live status, always re-open the store page directly."
